# The benchmark's own trajectories, regenerated by `dataset.py --generate`
# in an environment with `clrs`: 227 MB of arrays that no diff should carry.
# The `val` splits stay, because `test/neural/test_clrs_smoke.py` runs the
# whole example on four of their trajectories and skips itself without them
# -- 578 KB for a test that would otherwise never run in CI.
data/*.npz
!data/*-val.npz

# Trained weights; the reports beside them are the results and are kept.
artifacts/*.pt
artifacts/**/*.pt
__pycache__/
